# Explicit floors matching the native platform targets we ship against.
# Without these the queries above resolve to ~Chrome 109 / iOS 18.5, far above
# minSdkVersion 29 (android/variables.gradle) and IPHONEOS_DEPLOYMENT_TARGET 15.0.
# iOS matters most: WKWebView is tied to the OS version and cannot be updated
# separately, so the iOS floor here must match the deployment target.
# Note: no "Android >= 90" line - browserslist's `android` key only tracks the
# single newest WebView release, so it would be a no-op. `Chrome >= 90` is what
# governs Android System WebView.
Chrome >= 90
iOS >= 15
Safari >= 15
